AUDIO: 'migration is really straightforward. You just need to grab the Docker Compose file that was already pointed at your LocalStack setup, swap one line, and that\'s it. And if you\'re testing lambda functions specifically and you use test'

[06:20] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'containers, Flow Key ships a module for that, too, so you can spin this whole thing up and tear it down inside an actual test suite instead of managing a separate container yourself. So, there'

